Q: Cannot read property &#39;length&#39; of undefined&quot; A: <p>I also had this problem, I imported a sass style sheet with functions(@mixins) and a sass style sheet with variables into one sass style sheet.</p>
<p>I imported them as (
@import url('./_variables.scss');
@import url('./_func.scss');
) so i just took out the 'url()' for both import statements and that error went away.</p>

Q: TypeError: app.use() requires middleware functions A: <p>In my case this error happened due to writing</p>
<pre><code>app.use('/v1/tutorials');
</code></pre>
<p>instead of</p>
<pre><code> app.use('/v1/tutorials',router);
</code></pre>
